Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得爸爸想让我们继承他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Dad wants us to pick up those he's left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他人 猎杀恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炼狱中有着比那些灵魂更加古老的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things much older than souls in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得是佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you got to be the shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而大鱼吃小鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shark's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们的时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's your time…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别留恋人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是神之语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the word of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写着关于利维坦的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有写怎么杀死他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it say anything about how to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这些魔怪死了之后 魂归何处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we freaks die, where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你最糟的恶魔最阴暗的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the backside of your worst nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了血腥尸骨和无尽的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all blood and bone and darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩其首 躯体挣扎凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut off the head, and the body will flounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,先知我带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prophet's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你这次真的是得独自面对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are well and truly on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我想我们还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I think we better g…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.31,0:01:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:17.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:19.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（缅因州 一百英里原野）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:22.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚有什么事发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,去啊 别愣着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该干什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what am I supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚 像是一只鹿之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It was like … it was a deer or some… oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走下去12英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 miles that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（路易斯安那州 克莱顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:50.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（四天后）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.63,0:03:32.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉斐特）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最好是你的坟 狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be you, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动作倒挺快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能指望你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么耽搁了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体还好用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就按之前商定的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we talked about, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就此别过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹事 本尼 听着了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your nose clean, Benny. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了 兄弟 我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it, brother. I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩都逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（得克萨斯州 克米特）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙大拿州 恢特菲什）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?! What the …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是利维坦 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a Leviathan. What …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要 我知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to. I know it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迪恩 我能就道声好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Dean, can I just say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道是该跟你拥抱还是去洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether to give you a hug or take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…freakin' alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是我们站得离迪克太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess standing too close to exploding Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸把我们也送去了炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}sends your ass straight to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前在炼狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了整整一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the whole year?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 整天逃命的话时间就过得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, time flies when you're running for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想建造了炼狱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess whoever built that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也并不想让我待在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't want me in there any more than I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出来了 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小卡呢 他也在那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Cass? Was he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡没能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Cass didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在下面出了点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to him down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后情况变得很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things got pretty hairy towards the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他就放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he…just let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小卡死了 你亲眼看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Cass is dead? You saw him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么说 你也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then what, you're not sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我看得够多了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I saw enough, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你 我都不敢相信你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you … I can't believe you're actually here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你一半的号码都停机了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that half your numbers are out of service?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉给你的留言都打水漂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt like I was leaving messages in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我没收到你的留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I-I didn't get your messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是因为我把电话扔掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because I ditched the phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,原因呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一年里我也经历了很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess something happened to me this year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做猎人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hunt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莎·格蕾（美国著名AV女星）还去演正剧了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sasha Grey's gone legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的确参演了一部索德伯格的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, she did a Soderbergh movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 她拍了部索德伯格的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - She did a soderbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 说的是你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 因为你不见了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I … you were gone…Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡也不见了 鲍比也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass was gone, Bobby was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力把凯文和梅格不知道弄去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Crowley even shipped off Kevin and Meg to parts unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就能逃离我们的家族事业吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just turned tail on the family business?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人都死光了还哪来的「家族」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing says "family" quite like the whole family being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我陷在上帝的腋窝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I was knee-deep in God's armpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.75,0:10:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这是我们应该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, I thought, is what we actually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知 正是我们做的这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And far as I knew, what we do is the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死了我所有的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got every single member of my family killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个亲人也没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no one … no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有生以来 第一次完全孤立无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the first time in my life, I was completely alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有说实话 我没有地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, honestly, I didn't exactly have a roadmap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有我修好了英帕拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, I fixed up the Impala,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开车上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just…drove.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你先去找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you looked for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找我了吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you look for me, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是叮嘱对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we … we…always told each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要去寻找对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to look for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明智 对你是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's smart. Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.37,0:11:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们从来不管那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we always ignored that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们对彼此有深厚不变的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of our deep, abiding love for each another,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次你放弃了 是不是 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not this time, right, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我还是原来那个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm still the same guy, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, bully for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特 我是凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester, it's Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力把我关在一间仓库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley had me in this warehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.73,0:12:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 他或者其他恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know if he or … or any other demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是还在追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}are still after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回电 我是凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me back. It's Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特 我是凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester. It's Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周前我打来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called you a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:12:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我该怎么办 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell I'm doing out here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 制定计划什么的吗 - 萨姆 我是凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- strategize or something? - Sam, it's Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! I'm so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he…drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从三个月前你抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 months since you ditched my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就没睡过一个安稳觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't slept for more than four hours a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good in the hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还活着 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if you're still alive, eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 已经半年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's been 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能以为你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only assume you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没死 也不要找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, don't try and reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找不到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再打来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be calling this number anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却连电话也不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you couldn't answer the damn phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to this …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文最后一条留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's last message.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听背景音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没死 也不要找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, don't try and reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找不到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再打来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be calling this number anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像在大巴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he was on a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再听一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没死 也不要找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, don't try and reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点站 山特维尔市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last stop … Centreville.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再打来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…won't be calling this number …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,山特维尔市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Centreville?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山特维尔市在哪里 - 密歇根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Centreville, where? - Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么凯文会在密歇根洲的山特维尔市\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would Kevin be in Centreville, Michigan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 他高中的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because… his high-school girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}goes to college there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:37.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（钱宁 山特维尔州立大学）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,线索太少\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最好的一条线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best lead we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去找他 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…let's find him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似没伤害我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… no visible signs of douchery …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到狗的味道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell like dog to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way, I am not dead at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:16:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里 上路如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hey, what do you say we blow this joint, hit the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 凯文不会自己出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, kevin's not getting any more found.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我们 这孩子也活了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid survived a year without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再坚持12个小时应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be okay for another 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你多久没睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, when's the last time you slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挂靴一年就是这么给自己找理由的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that, uh, that how you rationalized taking a year off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我们别人也不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不会啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}People were okay, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.09,0:18:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我履行了我们的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I did what we promised we'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放下过去 好好过日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I moved on. I lived my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I'm getting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是什么都不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it wasn't like I was…just oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我每天读报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I read the paper every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到灵异事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the…weird stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前对付的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kind of stuff we used to chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你对自己说「不关我事」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said what? "Not my problem"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 地球还是一样转\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? The world went on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死去 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}People died, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.54,0:18:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总是要死的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will always die, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会有其他猎人去处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe another hunter took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我要说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but the point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time, I realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩妖除魔不非得靠我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it wasn't only up to me to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what was it, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你就那么退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly make you stop just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关那女孩的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来又没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会觉得难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know this is gonna sound crazy to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不非得理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even necessarily need you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是突然就退出了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't just drop out, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些我这辈子从未拥有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I've…never had all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么搞在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you dropped your peanut butter in her chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撞了条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说有狗味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I smelled dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会发飙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew you'd throw bitch fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事很简单 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the rules are simple, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不抽陌生人的大麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't take a joint from a guy named Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不带狗上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no dogs in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么了 - 你瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about me? - Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've still got that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧张 不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're shaky. You're on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了你也不会信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,肮脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种底层的恶心东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}31 flavors of bottom-dwelling nasties.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分时候是上下左右受敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, most days felt like 360-degree combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在那里 有种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was something about being there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 救你一命都不说句谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No thanks for saving you, ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我就不用这个捅死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I won't shove this up your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么对待你生存下去的机会啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful strange way to punch your meal ticket, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.73,0:21:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你这种怪物也知道根本没法离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even a dental apocalypse like you knows there's no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人就能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is if you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是上帝的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has made it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少传言如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, that's the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.19,0:21:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你是待惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've gone native.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你就是喜欢留在这儿给人当饭吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you like being man meat for every Tom, Dick, and Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不来拉倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either in or you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是善心大发\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just want to guide me out of purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.33,0:22:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,想带我离开炼狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the goodness of your undead heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.15,0:22:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.52,0:22:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭个顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hopping a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.87,0:22:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个人类传送门 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a human portal, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.39,0:22:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅限人类通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only humans can pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你找到门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I show you the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的灵魂带过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hump my soul to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是要辆灵魂列车（美国一档音乐节目）喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're looking for a soul train.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这么说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you're into.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你不是给我下套\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do I know this isn't a set-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道我不会跟你朋友一个下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know I ain't gonna end up like your friend over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.59,0:22:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.53,0:22:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱第一规则 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}First rule of purgatory, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.79,0:22:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都别信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't trust nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚还想让我信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just asked me to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是开窍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.61,0:22:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先去找天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}First we find the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.11,0:22:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人太挤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, three's a crowd, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不来拉倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you're in or you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后一次见凯文是一年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time I saw Kevin was, like, a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失踪前吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷了他妈妈的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole his mother's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得自己要去完成什么上帝的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he thought he was on a mission from God or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.29,0:23:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友亚当 嗑安非他命上瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend Adam … who got addicted to adderall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他SAT成绩超好 所以值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but got a perfs on his S.A.T.s, so it was totally worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也是这种情况 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- same thing. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.71,0:23:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 也是上帝的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. Mission from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.39,0:23:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Channing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道凯文来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know Kevin was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.13,0:23:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.96,0:23:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是想保护他 我们能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we understand if you're trying to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们才是最有能力保护他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody can protect Kevin better than we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌他 才不会保护他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate Kevin. I wouldn't protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是一对儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you two had a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.61,0:23:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去普林斯顿的时候我们是一对儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when he was going to Princeton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就情断义绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是来见她 凯文跑来这儿干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why would Kevin come sniffing around here if not to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:23:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.97,0:23:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该分头找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should split up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.95,0:24:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处问问有没有人见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask around, see if anybody's seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 在大学里找个这么高的亚裔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Asian kid, yea high, at a university.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不是大海捞针了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.61,0:24:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你准备好忘记过去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Are you ready to forget all about what's-his-name?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.93,0:24:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个男生 叫凯尔 犹太人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this guy's name is Kyle, he's Jewish,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.47,0:24:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以确定他对亚裔女孩有好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}um, I'm pretty sure he has an Asian thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.82,0:24:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.03,0:24:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先知还没来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prophet still has not yet shown his face to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是迪恩·温彻斯特回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should know Dean Winchester is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.61,0:25:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 救救这只狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. I need help. The dog needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.48,0:25:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就那么突然冲出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just … he just came out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.60,0:25:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲到我车前\N{\fnArial\fs30}right in front of my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找个医生 你是医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a doctor. Are you a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.09,0:25:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生就来 先生 我不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor's coming sir, I'm not sure …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.79,0:25:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不确定什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sure what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.55,0:25:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是动物医院 你们救治动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an animal hospital. You save animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.56,0:25:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 快救救它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - Save this animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.54,0:25:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯塔 请你带这位先生出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roberta, can you escort this gentleman out, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.83,0:25:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.11,0:25:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我撞了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.62,0:25:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.11,0:25:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别瞧不起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't judge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got bubkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And here you go. - Ah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.54,0:25:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.24,0:25:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for me? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.44,0:25:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.37,0:25:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查了凯文应该在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I went through campus security archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那段时间的校园保安档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}around the time Kevin should have been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得谁眼熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.76,0:26:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.70,0:26:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是无价之宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.19,0:26:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么凯文大老远跑来学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what, Kevin comes all the way to campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不去见女友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and doesn't see his girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.20,0:26:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我去了机房\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I went to the computer lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到了他用过的电脑 - 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and found the computer he was on. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.02,0:26:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查到了他浏览的网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found the website he was visiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.75,0:26:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的用户名 黑进了网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}found his account username, hacked in to the website,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.05,0:26:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到这个用户名还在什么时候登陆过\N{\fnArial\fs30}found when else this username logged in,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.00,0:26:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后反查IP地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I reverse-tracked the I.P. address.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到原始用户凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to the original user, Kevin,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个月来 都在使用同一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is apparently been using the same wireless router.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.31,0:26:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线路由器\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the past two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.39,0:26:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is spectacular work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.90,0:26:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用人话再说一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance I can get that in English?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我认为他在爱荷华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I think he's in Iowa …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一间咖啡店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a coffee shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.30,0:26:38.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱荷华州 费尔菲尔德）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.12,0:26:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂 你确定没错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A church? You sure this is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.14,0:26:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡店的吧员发誓说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barista at the coffee shop swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.43,0:26:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他见到凯文过去几个月一直藏在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's seen Kenvin ducking in here for the past few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:26:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam and Dean Winchester. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.73,0:27:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.05,0:27:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.81,0:27:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cliff notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.81,0:27:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了炼狱 萨姆撞了狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to purgatory. Sam hit a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.49,0:27:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.26,0:27:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要毛巾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some towels?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.14,0:27:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是谁教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who taught you all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.15,0:27:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是上帝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess…God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.69,0:27:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝教你怎么抓恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God taught you how to trap demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.34,0:27:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来讲 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.71,0:27:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.84,0:27:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳利抓走了你 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley kidnapped you. I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.90,0:27:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你留了条信息 说你逃出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you left a message saying you escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.25,0:27:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么逃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.66,0:27:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.33,0:27:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先是带我去了一间仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, he took me to a warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.70,0:28:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.66,0:28:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪了个头发 手脚指甲都修了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haircut, manicure, pedicure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.33,0:28:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,焕然一新啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a new penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.33,0:28:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们还要折磨我吗 - 折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will there be torture now? - Torture?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.00,0:28:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavens, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.97,0:28:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 恰恰相反 我的小王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Quite the opposite, my young prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.67,0:28:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我联合 不可阻挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sky's the limit for you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.76,0:28:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a tablet there,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像之前那块\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.02,0:28:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, remember …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.37,0:28:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,自信点 好好干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel like a winner, be a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.32,0:28:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.17,0:28:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interpret.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.33,0:28:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, there's another tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.12,0:28:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So another word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.21,0:28:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底有多少神之语啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many words of God are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.72,0:28:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一年前才成为先知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just became a prophet, like, a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.05,0:28:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块碑有名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, did this tablet have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「恶魔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Demons."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.82,0:28:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.09,0:28:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我读到的来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I could tell…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:28:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是关于恶魔的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.71,0:28:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.19,0:29:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是零零碎碎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all just fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.14,0:29:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,东一句西一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bits and pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.53,0:29:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个有点难\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.09,0:29:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点东西 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw me a bone here, Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.95,0:29:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.38,0:29:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.23,0:29:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 只有我觉得这里很热吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Is it just me, or is it hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.94,0:29:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.51,0:29:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.17,0:29:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我看到些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.85,0:29:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之门怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about hell gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.74,0:29:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯康星有扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one in Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.26,0:29:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,碑上讲了怎么开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablet told me how to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.37,0:29:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一道咒语所需的材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were ingredients for a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.22,0:30:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.71,0:30:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳利先生让你继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Crowley would like you to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.37,0:30:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳利先生人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Mr. Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.31,0:30:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢 蠢货 当然在威斯康星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think, dumbass? Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.88,0:30:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.17,0:30:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉地狱之王怎么开启地狱之门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed the king of hell how to open a hell gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.70,0:30:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让地狱里所有的恶魔一起跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that all the demons in hell could come out all at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.33,0:30:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.10,0:30:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.59,0:30:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.87,0:30:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.64,0:30:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.33,0:30:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟克劳利说我要开启地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Crowley I was opening a hell gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.90,0:30:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我读的是另一个章节\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was reading from another chapter …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.84,0:30:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to destroy demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.91,0:30:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.68,0:30:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块碑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the tablet now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.15,0:31:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.95,0:31:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.72,0:31:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. As long as it's safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.41,0:31:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把碑藏起来之前还读到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you able to read anything else off the tablet before you stash it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.61,0:31:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有怎么关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the stuff about closing the gate of Hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.68,0:31:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.69,0:31:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.43,0:31:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱逐地球上的所有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banish all demons off the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.81,0:31:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们永远关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock them away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.53,0:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该挺重要的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be important, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closing the gates of hell forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.69,0:31:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是该挺重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, that could be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.99,0:31:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子如果说对了 他手里就有个重磅炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if this kid is right, he's sitting on a bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个那个重磅炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, he is the bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.41,0:31:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.64,0:31:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.63,0:31:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's no way that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.38,0:31:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无伤的完成这件事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's getting out of this intact, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.82,0:31:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他到目前为止还挺能保护自己呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think he's doing pretty well for himself so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.84,0:32:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为他逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.67,0:32:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在他又加入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's in it…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他想不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether he likes it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.19,0:32:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 只有你能拥有自由意志吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…free will, that's only for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe what I'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.62,0:32:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这可是消灭一切恶魔的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we have an opportunity to wipe the slate clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.96,0:32:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带凯文去找碑 他告诉我们咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take Kevin to the tablet, he tells us the spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.45,0:32:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能把所有恶魔永远关在地狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we send every demon back to hell … forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个毁了我们生活的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single basters that destroyed our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.69,0:32:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些杀了妈妈 杀了杰西的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed our mother, killed Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.30,0:32:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么疑虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.87,0:32:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.02,0:32:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和迪恩都消失掉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, when you disappeared and Dean disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.15,0:33:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去清理下思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…needed to clear my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.50,0:33:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 有些事我本该去做 却没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…I'm thinking maybe you were one of the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你就是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I should have been there to pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.09,0:33:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从小就当上猎人了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a hunter since you were a kid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.98,0:33:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, mostly. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.34,0:33:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我意识到我是一个先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since I realized I was a prophet…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.87,0:33:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难相信这真的是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just hard to believe this is actually my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.97,0:33:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在很糟糕 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It sucks right now. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.63,0:33:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还会再糟糕挺长一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, it might suck for a lot longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.48,0:33:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 相信我 一切会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…trust me on this, it gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.70,0:33:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不搞基吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not gay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.30,0:33:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们真能找回石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can do this, get the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.45,0:33:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一切关闭地狱之门所需的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}get you everything you need to close the gates of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.15,0:33:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以创造一个新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a world out there where nobody …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没有克劳力或者任何恶魔来追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not crowley, no demon … is chasing you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.31,0:34:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我只是不知道怎样走到那一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just don't see how I get from here to there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.81,0:34:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也同样不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to not be able to see it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有方法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.29,0:34:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我5分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.90,0:34:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它遭受了严重的内出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sustained some serious internal bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我能看到至少有两条腿骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's at least two leg fractures that I can see right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.35,0:34:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是经过一些精心照料 它会渡过难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with some TLC, he should pull through for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.48,0:34:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.43,0:34:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把狗带走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.48,0:34:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想 但它不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I would. He's…not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.36,0:34:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就没有主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not anybody's.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.11,0:34:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常在路上跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I spend a lot of the time on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.15,0:34:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得你有责任吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think you're responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.60,0:34:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带它来就是觉得我负有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I brought him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.75,0:35:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯塔 他临走的时候请把他的奖杯给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roberta, could you hand this man his trophy on his way out, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真那么正直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe if you were such an upstanding guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.34,0:35:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许就不会撞伤它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't have hit him in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.03,0:35:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我把它带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.39,0:35:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.31,0:35:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.48,0:35:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.49,0:35:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.84,0:35:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱神器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.94,0:35:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特 从炼狱回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean winchester. Back from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.24,0:35:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔史班奇 我听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spanky the demon. Yeah, I heard about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.93,0:35:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爱咬人的那个 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who uses too much teeth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.12,0:36:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.92,0:36:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.67,0:36:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.99,0:36:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能说炼狱对你没什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just say purgatory didn't do you any favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.04,0:36:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.86,0:36:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你妈去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.19,0:36:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又来那小孩脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's that grade-school zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.23,0:36:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好怀念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed it. I really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.41,0:36:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还那么膀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still with the pork chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.95,0:36:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我钦佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.74,0:37:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,放钱宁走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Channing go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.54,0:37:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 那不是钱宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Channing, kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.48,0:37:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能说这种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an awful thing to say to the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.67,0:37:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这当然还是钱宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's Channing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.51,0:37:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.01,0:37:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次合作时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time we danced,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.51,0:37:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了我的石碑还杀了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole my tablet and killed my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.48,0:37:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.34,0:37:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟我走 那些事一笔勾销\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me now, bygones.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.14,0:37:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会让这女孩回到从前的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll let the girl go back to…what's-the-point u.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.82,0:37:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱宁不会变回来 她可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get Channing back. She's probably dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.17,0:37:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能别这样说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please stop saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.91,0:37:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那女孩说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the girl speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.16,0:37:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文 - 钱宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin? - Channing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.60,0:37:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.76,0:37:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个恶魔在你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a demon in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.54,0:37:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去你的保底学校念书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to your safety school.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.62,0:37:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 但你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - But it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.91,0:37:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I-I just … I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.02,0:37:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.85,0:37:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.48,0:37:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文 - 用我换那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin. - Myself for the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.77,0:37:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这事就此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.37,0:37:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 别再打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? No fighting, no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:37:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.96,0:38:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让你这么做 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't let you do that, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.12,0:38:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.67,0:38:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll grab my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.42,0:38:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin up, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.27,0:38:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.15,0:38:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事没完 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't over by a long shot, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.91,0:38:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这台词都谁写的 毫无气力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Dean, who writes your stuff? A marshmallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.47,0:38:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.52,0:38:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.37,0:38:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,太天真了吧 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.78,0:38:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.85,0:38:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.90,0:38:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.79,0:39:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去找个肉身来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find another meatsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.95,0:39:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,打错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.79,0:39:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一蠢货打来的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call that made by a jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.45,0:39:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, anybody want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.74,0:40:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.49,0:40:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.62,0:40:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How're you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.53,0:40:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王刚扭断了我女朋友的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell just snapped my girlfriend's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.38,0:40:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.52,0:40:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你女朋友的事很遗憾 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your girlfriend, okay? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.68,0:40:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越早想通对你越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the sooner you get this, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.89,0:40:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你喜不喜欢 你已经牵扯进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in it now whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.25,0:40:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你要做你必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you do what you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.85,0:40:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去上个厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hitting the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.61,0:40:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.24,0:40:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么弄到手机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.48,0:40:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能相信这东西现在便利店就有卖的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe they sell these things in convenience stores now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.30,0:40:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,50年变化很大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot's changed in 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.78,0:40:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有很多东西要适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a hell of a lot to take in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.62,0:40:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的变化是选择 你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly it's the choices, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.39,0:40:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.68,0:41:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.93,0:41:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 我不想多费唇舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, benny, not to beat a dead horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.22,0:41:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们在下面做了必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we did down there is what we had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.16,0:41:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是现在 我也一点不后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't regret it for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.49,0:41:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 或许在我们适应地上生活之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…you know, maybe until we both adjust,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.26,0:41:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好先不要联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's best we don't talk for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.22,0:41:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天一次 就像我们之前说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day at a time, just like we talked about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.87,0:41:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你是对的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you had it right, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.84,0:41:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.77,0:41:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱是很纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory was pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我当时知道珍惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kinda wish that I had appreciated it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.20,0:41:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.14,0:41:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.21,0:41:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是有紧急情况就打电话给我 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you got an emergency, you call me, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.95,0:41:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.73,0:41:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别惹事 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your nose clean, too, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.49,0:41:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
